{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6397","title":"Gran Turismo World Series 2026 Round 3 in Singapore: Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo Set to Launch in Gran Turismo 7 ","desc":"Both Xiaomi SU7 Ultra and Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo will be available in Gran Turismo's first EV Driving Experience Training","view_cnt":"1047","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1790749940","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/359_operatorx_operatorx_opx/03/10/2026/24b12d6de805beb4f2edf1030b020688.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSINGAPORE, October 3, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e — At the Gran Turismo World Series (\u003c/span\u003eGT World Series\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e) 2026 Round 3 in Singapore, Gran Turismo series Producer Kazunori Yamauchi and Jean-Arthur Madelaine, Head of Design from Xiaomi Europe R\u0026amp;D and Design Center at Xiaomi Auto, announced that Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo (Xiaomi Vision GT) will join \u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e (GT7) this October. The announcement also introduced Gran Turismo’s first \u003c/span\u003eEV Driving Experience\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e, featuring dedicated driving challenges and training with Xiaomi SU7 Ultra and Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo. Yamauchi and Madelaine took the stage together to discuss the development of Xiaomi Vision GT and the evolving experience of electric performance driving.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/907_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/03/10/2026/dd528de63d3f3fa49ba57bb194179fda.jpg\" alt=\"During an event, several hosts are discussing content related to \u0026quot;Gran Turismo 7\u0026quot; on stage, with the background displaying information about \u0026quot;Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo\u0026quot; and its upcoming launch. There is a car model on stage, surrounded by racing seats.\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Joins the Vision Gran Turismo Project as Its 36th Participating Brand\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eLaunched in 2013, Vision Gran Turismo invites leading brands to imagine and create original concept cars exclusively for the \u003cem\u003eGran Turismo\u003c/em\u003e series. Over the past decade, the project has brought together some of the world’s most renowned automotive marques and produced 50 Vision Gran Turismo models, establishing a unique platform at the intersection of automotive design, engineering and virtual racing culture.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eXiaomi is the 36th brand, and the first technology company, to join the Vision Gran Turismo project. Xiaomi Vision GT made its global debut at Mobile World Congress (MWC) 2026 in Barcelona, where it was unveiled by Xiaomi Auto Chief Designer Li Tianyuan and drew strong interest from automotive communities and car enthusiasts worldwide. The physical concept was subsequently showcased at Auto China 2026 in Beijing. Its arrival in \u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e marks the next milestone in Xiaomi Vision GT’s journey from design vision to an interactive driving experience for players worldwide.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Vision Gran Turismo: Sculpted by the Wind\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eXiaomi Vision GT is guided by the desi\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003egn philosophy “Sculpted by the Wind.” Rather than relying on deliberately sharpened surfaces or add-on aerodynamic elements, the car is shaped around a suspended teardrop-like cabin, with every surface aerodynamically optimized and every structural elemen\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003et designed with an airfoil cross-section. Building on aerodynamic solutions proven in production vehicles such as Xiaomi SU7 and Xiaomi YU7, Xiaomi Vision GT takes the approach further: its cross-shaped headlights also function as airflow guides, while the signature halo-shaped taillight is integrated into the rear air channel. Together with an active wake-control system, these features enable an aerodynamic efficiency value of 4.1 and a drag coefficient (Cd) of 0.29.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eXiaomi Vision GT also introduces the “Sofa Racer” concept, centered on a cocoon-like cockpit that combines comfort, immersion and driver focus. Powered by \u003c/span\u003eXiaomi Hyper XiaoAi AI Voice Assistant\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e and Xiaomi MiMo foundation model, the cockpit can anticipate and respond to driver intent while connecting naturally with Xiaomi’s \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem. Commenting on the design, Yamauchi said: “The overall design maintains its simplicity while revealing an indescribably sleek and incredibly sexy curved aesthetic. I believe this car will become a role model for this era.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKazunori Yamauchi and Jean-Arthur Madelaine: Xiaomi Vision GT Feels Incredibly Smooth in the Game\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYamauchi noted that Xiaomi Vision GT has generated strong interest among racing and gaming enthusiasts since its appearances at MWC Barcelona and Auto China earlier this year. The community’s anticipation of experiencing the vehicle in \u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e helped build momentum behind the collaboration.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eReflecting on his experience, Madelaine described Xiaomi Vision GT as a futuristic driver's car that is \"sculpted by the wind\", engineered to pursue the perfect balance between low drag and high downforce. In the game, it maintains both high speed and exceptional stability, resulting in an incredibly smooth overall driving experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e Introduces Its First EV Driving Experience\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont;\"\u003eThe two companies also announced that\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;will introduce its first EV Experience feature, with events featuring Xiaomi SU7 Ultra, Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo. The feature gives players a new way to explore the distinct acceleration, braking and handling characteristics of high-performance EVs within the authentic driving environment of\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont;\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/905_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/03/10/2026/262c2ebba236a1e0a7352bda33ca319e.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA New Chapter in Xiaomi Auto’s Connection with Global Car Culture\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWith Xiaomi SU7 Ultra joining \u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e, Xiaomi Vision GT entering the Vision Gran Turismo lineup, and both models featuring in the new \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont;\"\u003eEV Experience feature\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e, Xiaomi Auto is expanding its presence across production performance cars, visionary concept design and interactive driving experiences.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e players\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e worldwide will soon be able to drive Xiaomi Vision GT on iconic circuits including the Nürburgring, Le Mans and Suzuka. Through original design, advanced engineering and digital innovation, Xiaomi Auto will continue to contribute a distinctive perspective to global automotive and racing culture.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cvideo src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/801_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapVideo/03/10/2026/eb942bbebeff1606058db2ebeeba91df.mp4\" controls=\"true\"\u003e\u003csource src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/801_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapVideo/03/10/2026/eb942bbebeff1606058db2ebeeba91df.mp4\" controls=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/video\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e*All performance data for Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo were obtained through iterative simulated testing under simulated environment and do not represent actual on-road performance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eImages and videos \u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eavailable\u003c/span\u003e here\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/sites/InternationalPRRepository/Shared%20Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?id=%2Fsites%2FInternationalPRRepository%2FShared%20Documents%2FProducts%2FXiaomi%20EV%2FBrand%20Collaborations%2FXiaomi%20x%20Gran%20Tursimo%207\u0026amp;viewid=5bef4b05%2D232d%2D4945%2D9e9b%2Dd0b162d8493a\u0026amp;newTargetListUrl=%2Fsites%2FInternationalPRRepository%2FShared%20Documents\u0026amp;viewpath=%2Fsites%2FInternationalPRRepository%2FShared%20Documents%2FForms%2FAllItems%2Easpx\"\u003e：\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgCYOkvi50LrQ7TxB3y2sAy1AY0Tbh8Ab7CL9LoTTBHxack?e=OWMtcz\"\u003eXiaomi x Gran Turismo 7\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In June 2026, the MAU reached 766.5 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of June 30, 2026, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,160.8 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 800,000 units by September 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2026, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the eighth year in a row, ranking 232nd.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Gran Turismo\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eGran Turismo is a video game developed by Polyphony Digital Inc., a subsidiary of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc. Having launched in Japan first in 1997, the multi-award-winning franchise is regarded as the best and most authentic driving simulator due to true-to-life graphics, authentic physics technology and careful attention to detail. Polyphony and its famed creator Kazunori Yamauchi have revolutionized the racing game genre.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease visit at\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.gran-turismo.com/\"\u003e https://www.gran-turismo.com/\u003c/a\u003e or\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.polyphony.co.jp/\"\u003e https://www.polyphony.co.jp/\u003c/a\u003e .\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"132","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1791018337"},"common":null}